data: {"id":"chatcmpl-20261013162329258980930c955d568KIFB13Sd","created":1791908609,"object":"chat.completion.chunk","model":"glm-5.3-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_702ffa606ee64d05bb8f92ac","index":0,"type":"function","function":{"name":"write","arguments":"{\"content\":\"Proof Obligations for claim.txt / spec.txt\\n==========================================\\n\\nSpecification (spec.txt):\\n  forall x : Z. (x + 1) * (x - 1) = x * x - 1\\n\\nBackground axioms assumed (integer arithmetic):\\n  A1. Distributivity:  forall a, b, c : Z. a * (b + c) = a * b + a * c\\n  A2. Commutativity:   forall a, b : Z. a * b = b * a\\n  A3. Additive inverse: forall a : Z. a + (-1 * a) = 0   (i.e., a - a = 0)\\n  A4. Unit:            forall a : Z. 1 * a = a\\n  A5. Well-definedness of +, *, unary minus on Z (closure, totality)\\n\\nObligation 1: Well-typedness (well-formed formula)\\n  The formula forall x : Z. (x + 1) * (x - 1) = x * x - 1 is well-formed:\\n  all terms are of type Z, x is bound, and no variable is free.\\n\\nObligation 2: Well-definedness of the terms\\n  For all x : Z, the terms (x + 1), (x - 1), and x * x are defined\\n  (total) and of type Z, by A5.\\n\\nObligation 3: Main proof obligation (the claim itself)\\n  forall x : Z. (x + 1) * (x - 1) = x * x - 1\\n  Proof sketch:\\n    (x + 1) * (x - 1)\\n      = (x + 1) * x + (x + 1) * (-1)        by A1\\n      = (x * x + 1 * x) + (-1 * x + 1 * -1) by A1, A2\\n      = (x * x + x) + (-x + -1)             by A4\\n      = x * x + (x + (-x)) + (-1)           by associativity of +\\n      = x * x + 0 + (-1)                    by A3\\n      = x * x - 1                           by A3/A4\\n  QED\\n\\nObligation 4: No vacuity / non-triviality side condition\\n  Z is non-empty (e.g., 0 : Z), so the universal quantifier ranges\\n  over a non-empty domain; the theorem is not vacuously true.\\n\\nEach obligation must be discharged for the claim to be established;\\nObligation 3 is the essential (semantic) one.\\n\",\"filePath\":\"/home/agent/workspace/obligations.txt\"}"}}]}}]}

